# 🚀 Pipeline Pattern (`src/lib/pipeline`)

> **Laravel-style sequential pipeline with atomic batch transactions for Cloudflare D1 & SQLite.**
> 100% agnostic to **Drizzle ORM** and **Native Cloudflare D1 (`D1Database`)**.
> **Strict Direct Imports Rule**: No barrel files (`index.ts`). Import directly from each file.

